{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Tui Shou: Sokoban&quot; is a 2D Sokoban-style puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to push boxes marked with different attributes while following rock-paper-scissors rules to move them to designated spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful! Some incorrect moves will cause boxes to disappear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let the challenge begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the Trial Version:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This app is the demo version of &quot;Tui Shou: Sokoban&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can experience the core mechanics and early main levels of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The trial version includes selected stages from the first three chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hope you enjoy the gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the official version:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Rock-Paper-Scissors&quot; will introduce more gameplay mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover additional levels and chapters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist it now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sokoban, but with Rock-Paper-Scissors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784410/extras/tuishou_temp_1.gif?t=1749567034\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must not lose before reaching the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784410/extras/tuishou_temp_2.gif?t=1749567034\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want more companions? Let's play Rock-Paper-Scissors too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784410/extras/tuishou_temp_3.gif?t=17495